Code	Meaning	        Example
%d	    Day	            24
%m	    Month	        05
%Y	    Full Year	    2026
%y	    Short Year	    26
%H	    Hour (24h)	    14
%I	    Hour (12h)	    02
%M	    Minutes	        30
%S	    Seconds	        45
%p	    AM/PM	        PM
%A	    Full Weekday	Saturday
%B	    Full Month	    May